Hibdilpop is a middle-aged [[Bestiary/Spark of Humanity#Gnome|Gnome]] from [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Haven/index|Haven]]. He's short, even for his ancestry, and has a shock of red hair atop his head (as well as out his ears). Hibdilpop works as a travelling salesman for the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Haven/Honeydew Meadery|Honeydew Meadery]], and sells kegs of their beverages to taverns in the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/index|Gulch]] wholesale.
